            "When you make a check to get others to follow your lead (such as a Command [Fire] check to lead a charge or a Performance [Fire] check to inspire others), you must choose and reroll two dice containing success or explosive success. After resolving the check, if you failed, you gain 1 Void point."
        }
    }

    ^"Whispers of Poverty" DEF {
