            "When you make a check to get others to trust you (such as a Courtesy [Air] check to convince someone of your sincerity or a Skulduggery [Air] check to act covertly while someone is aware of your presence), you must choose and reroll two dice containing success or explosive success. After resolving the check, if you failed, you gain 1 Void point."
